{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"一、十有四年，春正月，公會鄭伯于曹。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"二、無冰。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"何以書？記異也。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"三、夏五。鄭伯使其弟語來盟。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"夏五者何？無聞焉爾。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"四、秋八月壬申，御廩災。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"御廩者何？粢盛委之所藏也。御廩災，何以書？記災也。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"五、乙亥甞。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"常事不書，此何以書？譏。何譏爾？譏甞也。曰：「猶甞乎？」御廩災不如勿甞而已矣！","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"六、冬十有二月丁巳，齊侯祿父卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"七、宋人以齊人、衞人、蔡人、陳人伐鄭。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_25_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_25","textTraditional":"以者何？行其意也。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}